            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Ahaziya aratanga, nk’ ukw ijambo Uhoraho yavugishije Eliya ryavuze. Maze kukw ata mwana w’umuhungu yagira, murumuna we Yehoramu asubira ku ngoma yiwe; hari mu mwaka ugira kabiri Yehoramu mwene Yehoshafati umwami w’Abayuda ari ku ngoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
